the count and class each reason carries, that every cross leg naming a removed operand bin is removed with it, that
cmp_zca declares exactly the 21 shapes the census's not_hit table reads at every seed, and that every manifest renders
from its module with zero diff. Exit 0 only when every expectation holds."""
